		SCOPE: Compiling Natural-Language Policies into Neurosymbolic Predicate Programs


The SCOPE benchmark evaluates guardrail classifiers on policies that are too compound to be checked in one step. Each task pairs a single natural-language rule with inputs that satisfy or violate it for distinct, often interacting reasons, so a correct verdict depends on resolving several sub-questions rather than matching a surface pattern. The tasks span recommendation output verification… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Plurai/SCOPE.","downloads":2,"likes":0,"cardData":{"license":"mit","task_categories":["text-classification"],"language":["en"],"configs":[{"config_name":"fitness_coaching","data_files":[{"split":"test","path":"fitness_coaching/test-*"},{"split":"train","path":"fitness_coaching/train-*"}]},{"config_name":"message_repetition_with_escalation","data_files":[{"split":"test","path":"message_repetition_with_escalation/test-*"},{"split":"train","path":"message_repetition_with_escalation/train-*"}]},{"config_name":"plan_verification","data_files":[{"split":"test","path":"plan_verification/test-*"},{"split":"train","path":"plan_verification/train-*"}]},{"config_name":"finance_tile_resolution","data_files":[{"split":"test","path":"finance_tile_resolution/test-*"},{"split":"train","path":"finance_tile_resolution/train-*"}]}]},"siblings":[{"rfilename":".gitattributes"},{"rfilename":"README.md"},{"rfilename":"finance_tile_resolution/test-00000-of-00001.parquet"},{"rfilename":"finance_tile_resolution/train-00000-of-00001.parquet"},{"rfilename":"fitness_coaching/test-00000-of-00001.parquet"},{"rfilename":"fitness_coaching/train-00000-of-00001.parquet"},{"rfilename":"message_repetition_with_escalation/test-00000-of-00001.parquet"},{"rfilename":"message_repetition_with_escalation/train-00000-of-00001.parquet"},{"rfilename":"plan_verification/test-00000-of-00001.parquet"},{"rfilename":"plan_verification/train-00000-of-00001.parquet"},{"rfilename":"task_definitions.json"}],"createdAt":"2026-10-11T08:05:39.000Z","usedStora